WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
HookCut turns one long video into viral short clips.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.900
Your dashboard keeps every video and clip in one place.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.400
Add a video — upload a file, or paste a YouTube link.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.900
HookCut downloads and analyzes it automatically.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.400
AI finds the most viral moments and ranks them by score.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.900
Every clip gets a viral score, a hook, and AI analysis.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.400
Open the editor to fine-tune captions and reframe to 9:16.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.900
All your clips live in the Clips library, ready to post.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.900
Or combine the best moments into one Highlight Reel.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.900
Set your defaults once — clip count, caption style, reframe.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.900
Track what's working in Analytics.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.400
That's HookCut. Paste a link and get your first clips.
